  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Makambako Songea RE - Makambako Songea RE NS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Makambako Songea el</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Makambako-Songea transmission line and distribution   lines to provide sustained access to reliable and affordable          electricity within six districts in the Iringa and Ruvuma regions of  Southern Tanzania (Ref 71002060 credit part)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konstruktion av Makambako-Songea transmission och                     distributions-linjer f&#xf6;r tillg&#xe5;ng till h&#xe5;llbar, tillf&#xf6;rlig            elektricitet till &#xf6;verkomligt pris inom sex distrikt i regionerna     Iringa och Ruvuma i s&#xf6;dra Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The major objective of the project was to extend TANESCOs electricity network in order to provide electricity to commercial business activities, fresh water pumping, secondary schools, medical services, streetlights, residential houses, etc. within the project area. The project aimed to provide and improve supply of electricity to economic centers, social and welfare utilities and households in rural villages, peri-urban areas and towns in Njombe and Ruvuma regions in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
